---
import Analytics from '../components/Analytics.astro';
import Favicon from '../components/Favicon.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import glossary from '../data/glossary.json';
import { siteCopy } from '../lib/site-copy';
import '../styles/global.css';

const copy = siteCopy.ko;
const canonical = new URL('/glossary/', 'https://blog.botanicsoft.com').toString();
const groups = glossary.categories.map((category) => ({
  label: category.label,
  terms: glossary.terms.filter((term) => term.category === category.key),
}));
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{copy.glossaryTitle} | {copy.brandName}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={copy.glossaryDescription} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <Favicon />
    <Analytics />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header locale="ko" page="home" />
    <main class="container prose static-page">
      <h1>{copy.glossaryTitle}</h1>
      <p>글에서 같은 뜻으로 쓰는 표준 표기와 정의를 모았다. 본문의 용어는 첫 등장에서 이 페이지로 연결된다.</p>
      {groups.map((group) => (
        <>
          <h2>{group.label}</h2>
          {group.terms.map((term) => (
            <section id={term.id} class="glossary-term">
              <h3>{term.term}</h3>
              <p>{term.definition}</p>
              <p class="glossary-variants">같은 뜻으로 쓰지 않는 표기: {term.forbidden.join(', ')}</p>
            </section>
          ))}
        </>
      ))}
    </main>
    <Footer locale="ko" />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .glossary-term {
    scroll-margin-block-start: var(--space-8);
  }

  .glossary-variants {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
</style>
